OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after pedestrian
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fpedestrian in his 80s died after being
OL,8,Fhit by a Vauxhall Astra.
OL,10,FNorthamptonshire Police said it
OL,11,Fhappened on Cottingham Road in Corby at
OL,12,Fabout 16:30 BST on Saturday.
OL,14,FThe man was taken to hospital where he
OL,15,Fdied from his injuries.
OL,17,FThe driver of the blue Astra, a man in
OL,18,Fhis 40s, was arrested at the scene on
OL,19,Fsuspicion of causing death by dangerous
OL,20,Fdriving and has been released on bail.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
